{"id":"74c3063d074d3786","group":"88","path":"88/88-prop-universal-tm.md","title":"Universal Turing Machine","display":"prop-universal-tm — Universal Turing Machine","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-prop-universal-tm","aliases":["88-prop-universal-tm"],"display":"prop-universal-tm — Universal Turing Machine","depends_on":["[[88-df-universal-tm]]","[[88-df-turing-machine]]","[[88-df-tm-halts]]","[[88-df-tm-output]]","[[88-df-encoding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-prop-universal-tm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-prop-universal-tm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-universal-tm — Universal Turing Machine"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"74864270657b435d\" href=\"?note=74864270657b435d\" title=\"88-df-universal-tm\">88-df-universal-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a93cc0702f1280f5\" href=\"?note=a93cc0702f1280f5\" title=\"88-df-tm-halts\">88-df-tm-halts</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fff1247dc8d93b4d\" href=\"?note=fff1247dc8d93b4d\" title=\"88-df-tm-output\">88-df-tm-output</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (effective enumeration of binary-input Turing machines)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> (Turing-machine class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalTM}(U,(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N})\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalTM}(U,(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N})\\)</span> (universality predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"74864270657b435d\" href=\"?note=74864270657b435d\" title=\"88-df-universal-tm\">88-df-universal-tm</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}universal\\text{-}tm} \\vdash\n\\exists U\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\n\\mathrm{UniversalTM}(U,(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}universal\\text{-}tm} \\vdash\n\\exists U\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\n\\mathrm{UniversalTM}(U,(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>该命题断言定义谓词的见证存在，不再重复展开 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"74864270657b435d\" href=\"?note=74864270657b435d\" title=\"88-df-universal-tm\">88-df-universal-tm</a> 的全部公式。</li>\n<li>通用机同时保持停机/发散行为；只有在停机前提下才比较输出。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-universal-tm","status":"resolved","id":"74864270657b435d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-universal-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc676c7a4a4b11","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-halts","status":"resolved","id":"a93cc0702f1280f5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-halts]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-output","status":"resolved","id":"fff1247dc8d93b4d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-output]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc676c7a4a4b11","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}$ (Turing-machine class, see [[88-df-turing-machine]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-universal-tm","status":"resolved","id":"74864270657b435d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{UniversalTM}(U,(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N})$ (universality predicate, see [[88-df-universal-tm]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-universal-tm","status":"resolved","id":"74864270657b435d","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"该命题断言定义谓词的见证存在，不再重复展开 [[88-df-universal-tm]] 的全部公式。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniversalTM}(U,(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}universal\\text{-}tm} \\vdash\n\\exists U\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\n\\mathrm{UniversalTM}(U,(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N})","display":true}],"bytes":1026,"backlinks":[{"id":"74864270657b435d","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本原子只定义通用性谓词；通用机的存在性由 [[88-prop-universal-tm]] 断言。"}],"outgoing":["74864270657b435d","e0bc676c7a4a4b11","a93cc0702f1280f5","fff1247dc8d93b4d","3b05ff7db230d81f"]}